        "Description": "read output of data bit 1 (inputs A/B, threshold 0.125): OUT = NAND(MA, MB), the 2-to-1 MUX of the shipped example (#1059); the tap R1 is renamed here. The whole RAM composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
